{"id": "DfThuKsIXva", "title": "Video by vigyan_bhairav__", "description": "Method 5: The Ray of Light 🌅✨🕉️\n\nThis is the secret to experiencing Bhairav within you, and it begins at the base of your spine.\n\nIn Method 4, the power came to rest at the end of the breath. Now, Bhairav shows that same power rising as light.\n\nSee it as a ray (kirana), shining like the sun and the moon.\n\n🔴 It begins at the root of the spine: mooladhara.\n🌫️ As it rises, it grows subtle (sukshma), and then subtler still.\n👑 Higher and higher, until it reaches the crown of the head: sahasrara.\n\nThe breath does the same. It leaves the heart, grows finer, and falls quiet twelve fingers beyond, at dvadashanta.\n\nAnd at the crown, the light dissolves into pure awareness.\n\n⚠️ You do not force this. You only contemplate it (chintan), again and again.\n\nAnd slowly, Bhairav rises within you, until one day you know: I alone am Bhairav. 🔱\n\nFollow the light until it fades. What remains is you.\n\n🧘 Try it: sit quietly with your eyes closed. Picture a fine ray of light rising from the base of your spine to the crown of your head, growing subtler as it climbs. Let it fade there, and rest. Comment ✨ if you felt it.\n\n📖 Vigyan Bhairav Tantra, Dharana 5 (verse 28)\n⬅️ New here? Start with Method 1 on my page.\nFollow for one method at a time 🪷\n\n#VigyanBhairavTantra #VigyanBhairav #Bhairava #Shiva #Shakti #Tantra #KashmirShaivism #Muladhara #Sahasrara #Dvadashanta #Sukshma #Chakras #InnerLight #Contemplation #Meditation #Mindfulness #SpiritualAwakening #Consciousness #Yoga #Mahadev #HarHarMahadev #Watercolor #WatercolorArt #MeditationReels #SpiritualReels #ReelsIndia", "channel": "vigyan_bhairav__", "uploader_id": "70392958166", "uploader": "Bhairav", "timestamp": 1793764162, "like_count": 567, "comment_count": 5, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/